[Music]  many mcu fans are eagerly awaiting the  upcoming spider-man no way home it can  be assumed that the multiverse which was  opened up in the loki series will really  take the spotlight in what will probably  be tom holland's last mcu appearance but  in 2022 we can also look forward to  several mcu hits after doctor strange  and the multiverse of madness is  scheduled for release in march taika  waititi's 4 love and thunder will be  released in may currently the latter is  still in the middle of filming which was  recently snapped by the british tabloid  daily mail the unofficial pictures  mainly feature christian bale in his new  role as gore the god butcher having not  been spotted with his outfit before  bale's appearance makes the shots all  the more interesting in fact gore's  looks and the comics aren't really  exciting he's just a grey-skinned alien  with a black cape including a cowl the  set photos do indeed show bale in his  silver grey outfit though many fans  complain that he looks more like a greek  stature than a fearsome villain although  these malicious tongues are not  completely wrong it can be assumed that  gore will be given a proper makeover in  the digital post-production thor love  and thunder will be released next year  on may 6th  what seemed almost impossible three  years ago turned into reality this year  the long-awaited snyder cut of justice  league by director zack snyder was  finally released after the movie also  received much better reviews than the  2017 cut the question of a sequel  naturally arises a recent interview with  producer charles roven to the hollywood  reporter could provide us with some  insight indeed rovan explained that  there is an agreement with warner  brothers which specifies that the  producer and his team must handle a  certain number of films especially those  related to man of steel the same applies  to new batman suicide squad or even  justice league films the reason for this  is that a producer is meant to remain  committed to a certain movie category  which is obviously not that easy in a  complex universe full of superheroes and  villains rowan himself is currently  working on other suicide squad movies  and estimates that he won't be working  on justice league 2 in the coming few  years should one be released at some  point however it is considered  guaranteed that rovan will be part of it  again it should be exciting to see how  the dc extended universe will develop in  the meantime an essential part of this  will be dc's major project the flash  which follows justice league in terms of  content and will be released on november  4th 2022  since its release in 2016 the netflix  series strange of things has not only  brought worldwide fame to a few  teenagers overnight but it has also  given the streaming provider one of the  most successful in-house productions in  the company's history the excitement for  the mystery series hasn't worn off to  this day which is why millions of fans  are still eagerly awaiting the release  of season 4. their patience is beginning  to wear thin and for good reason after  all the last season was released more  than two years ago already all the more  pleasing it is that netflix has now  shown mercy and published a few images  as well as a sneak peek in the teaser  you can get an exciting glimpse of the  upcoming season even though a release  this year is unfortunately out of the  question as you can see in the clip a  release is currently scheduled for the  coming year we will therefore have to  remain patient a little bit longer in  addition to visual highlights there is  also some more news regarding the future  of the netflix series series creator  sean levy told collider that the end of  the series is definitely imminent and  that the series finale is already being  considered in plain english this likely  means that season 4 will be followed by  a fifth and final season afterwards  there are various possibilities for  spin-offs that could significantly  expand the stranger things universe with  a serious huge popularity it is quite  possible that we'll have a much bigger  stranger things franchise in a few years  so what spin-offs would you like to see  or do you even believe a movie could be  just as successful feel free to drop a  comment down below  the future of the popular deadpool  franchise under disney's management has  long been in doubt all the more pleasing  it is now that there were actually first  progress reports from leading actor ryan  reynolds as part of a promotional tour  for his upcoming film free guide he gave  an interview to the us magazine collider  there he answered quite candidly the  questions about the current status of  the script as well as the expected start  of shooting according to his own  statement the likelihood of a filming  star in the upcoming year is about 70  percent in addition the 44 year old  announced that the script is at present  in a very active development phase and  that his co-writers are extremely smart  and talented the talk is of the two  sisters wendy molyneux and lizzie  mulliner laglan who are also in charge  of the animated series bob's burgers for  example this also makes it clear that  the authors of the previous movie red  reese and paul roernick are no longer  involved in the project it is therefore  apparent that for whatever reason  crucial personal changes have already  been made under disney's direction  according to kevin feige and ryan  reynolds however the r rating which is  so important for the film series is not  at risk reynolds himself could even  imagine making an appearance in another  movie from the mcu alongside deadpool 3.  he is said to be receptive to the idea  of disney bringing in his character in a  lot of crazy ways we are definitely  excited and look forward to more news  concerning deadpool 3.  in 2016 the netflix series lucifer was  released and now after the sixth and  final season it will come to an end fans  are naturally wondering will the duo of  lucifer and chloe be able to save the  world from doom a first trailer for the  season which will be available in about  a month provides answers to at least  some questions and gives us first  impressions of new characters especially  striking is the appearance of deadpool  star bryanna hildebrand who takes on the  role of the rebellious angel and  antagonist rory likewise noteworthy is  the teaser for some sort of animated  episode as well as the surprising return  of kevin alejandro as then how exactly  he has returned to the realm of living  is something we will soon find out as  lucifer season 6 will premiere in the us  on netflix on september 10th 2021  already  it has been known for some time that  sonic's later sidekick knuckles will  appear in the sequel to 2020 sonic the  hedgehog today we also know who will be  dubbing the skittish red aquina and it's  none other than the suicide squad star  idris alba via instagram alba shared a  picture of his character's clenched fist  putting an end to all speculation about  a possible casting of jason mamoa the  second sonic part follows on directly  from its forerunner and begins in the  tranquil life of sonic and his two  friends tom and maddie the letter taking  a little vacation leaving their beloved  blue hedgehog to take care of the house  but problems aren't long in coming dr  robotnik who has been exiled to a  mushroom planet sets out in search of an  overpowering emerald together with  knuckles whom he has manipulated in his  favor this emerald is capable of wiping  out entire civilizations given that  sonic would hardly stand a chance  against this evil plot all by himself he  gets support from tails who was teased  during the end credits of the first part  fans will have to wait a while before  sonic the hedgehog 2 however as it is  not scheduled to be released before  april 8th 2022  josh trang science fiction film  chronicle was released almost nine years  ago the story about the introverted  henry who later developed super powers  managed to inspire some viewers even  though the reviews were not overly  positive every now and then fans asked  frank about a sequel but he made a  statement about it last year affirming  that he would not make a second part  producer john davis seems to have a  different view of things not having  written off the project yet in an  interview with forbes the producer  talked about having a female protagonist  as to focus this time around telling her  own superpower story the story is to be  said about 10 years after the first part  sounds pretty good right but variety  reporter adam b vary considers the  anticipation for part 2 to be a bit too  hasty apparently there's little progress  from idea to production and if anything  it is a very early stage of development  so barry tried to get in touch with john  davis the latter however just put him  off as he could not comment on the  current state of affairs so chronicle 2  isn't quite as certain as one might  think at first and in any case we'll  have to be patient for a couple of years  [Music]

